nment","d":"Union","correct":"A","exp":"Cartel"},{"q":"OPEC is an example of","a":"Cartel","b":"Monopoly","c":"Perfect competition","d":"Trade union","correct":"A","exp":"OPEC cartel"},{"q":"Labour demand is","a":"Direct demand","b":"Derived demand","c":"Independent","d":"Supply","correct":"B","exp":"Derived from product demand"},{"q":"Wage is price of","a":"Capital","b":"Labour","c":"Land","d":"Entrepreneur","correct":"B","exp":"Wage = labour"},{"q":"Rent is price of","a":"Labour","b":"Land","c":"Capital","d":"Entrepreneur","correct":"B","exp":"Rent = land"},{"q":"Interest is price of","a":"Labour","b":"Land","c":"Capital","d":"Entrepreneur","correct":"C","exp":"Interest = capital"},{"q":"Profit is reward for","a":"Labour","b":"Land","c":"Capital","d":"Entrepreneur","correct":"D","exp":"Profit = entrepreneur"},{"q":"Trade union aims to","a":"Increase wages / improve conditions","b":"Reduce wages","c":"Increase profit","d":"Reduce employment","correct":"A","exp":"Trade union"},{"q":"Minimum wage is an example of","a":"Price ceiling","b":"Price floor","c":"Equilibrium","d":"Tax","correct":"B","exp":"Price floor in labour market"},{"q":"Unemployment where people are between jobs is","a":"Structural","b":"Frictional","c":"Cyclical","d":"Seasonal","correct":"B","exp":"Frictional"},{"q":"Unemployment due to change in technology / skills mismatch is","a":"Frictional","b":"Structural","c":"Cyclical","d":"Seasonal","correct":"B","exp":"Structural"},{"q":"Unemployment due to recession is","a":"Frictional","b":"Structural","c":"Cyclical","d":"Seasonal","correct":"C","exp":"Cyclical"},{"q":"Unemployment due to seasonal work is","a":"Seasonal","b":"Frictional","c":"Structural","d":"Cyclical","correct":"A","exp":"Seasonal"},{"q":"Full employment means","a":"Zero unemployment","b":"Zero cyclical unemployment","c":"Zero frictional","d":"Everyone working","correct":"B","exp":"Natural rate, no cyclical"},{"q":"GDP is","a":"Total value of goods/services produced in country in a year"